==Spin-off==
On November 27, 2025, [[Apple TV (streaming service)|Apple TV]] reportedly greenlit a prequel series set during the [[Cold War]] with [[Wyatt Russell]] reprising his role as young Lee Shaw and serving as an executive producer. [[Joby Harold]] was reported to serve as showrunner and executive produce with his wife and producing partner [[Tory Tunnell]] through their production company Safehouse Pictures.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.nexuspointnews.com/post/exclusive-monarch-legacy-of-monsters-prequel-series-greenlit-at-apple-with-wyatt-russell-returning|title=EXCLUSIVE: ''Monarch: Legacy Of Monsters'' Prequel Series Greenlit At Apple With Wyatt Russell Returning|date=November 27, 2025|access-date=December 6, 2025|first=Matthew|last=W.|work=Nexus Point News}}</ref> In June 2026, it was reported that [[Millie Brady]] and [[Pilou Asbæk]] had been cast opposite Russell, while [[J. D. Dillard]] was tapped to direct the pilot episode.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://deadline.com/2026/06/apple-monsterverse-series-cast-millie-brady-pilou-asbaek-1236965407/|title=Wyatt Russell-Led Monsterverse Series Casts Millie Brady & Pilou Asbaek; JD Dillard To Direct Pilot|first=Rosy|last=Cordero|work=Deadline|date=June 23, 2026|access-date=August 14, 2026}}</ref> In July 2026, [[Corey Stoll]], [[Ralph Ineson]] and [[Nyasha Hatendi]] joined the cast of the series.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://deadline.com/2026/07/apple-monsterverse-series-cast-corey-stoll-1236999454/|title=Corey Stoll, Ralph Ineson & Nyasha Hatendi Join Wyatt Russell-Led Monsterverse Series|first=Rosy|last=Cordero|work=Deadline|date=July 21, 2026|access-date=August 14, 2026}}</ref> In August 2026, [[Connie Nielsen]] and [[Stana Katic]] joined the cast.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://deadline.com/2026/08/connie-nielsen-stana-katic-cast-apple-tv-monsterverse-1237029716/|title= Connie Nielsen & Stana Katic Join Wyatt Russell-Led Monsterverse Series For Apple TV|date=August 10, 2026|access-date=August 10, 2026|first=Rosy|last=Cordero|work=Deadline}}</ref> In November 2026, [[Tim Robbins]] and [[Giancarlo Esposito]] were added to the cast as guest stars,<ref>{{Cite web |last=Cordero |first=Rosy |date=2026-11-05 |title=Tim Robbins & Giancarlo Esposito Join Apple's Monsterverse Series |url=https://deadline.com/2026/11/tim-robbins-giancarlo-esposito-cast-monsterverse-series-1237214807/ |access-date=2026-11-05 |website=Deadline}}</ref> while [[Michiel Huisman]], Samuel Armfield and Erik Alens joined the cast in recurring roles.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Cordero |first=Rosy |date=2026-11-17 |title=Michiel Huisman, Samuel Armfield & Erik Alens Join Apple TV’s Wyatt Russell-Led Monsterverse Series|url=https://deadline.com/2026/11/michiel-huisman-samuel-armfield-erik-alens-monsterverse-1237226910/|access-date=2026-11-17 |website=Deadline}}</ref>

